            0.381
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In other words, the amount deposited, Amount after 1 year ₹6000, will become 110% (or increase by 10%),"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.282,
            0.388,
            0.718,
            0.415
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_20_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "6000 \\times 110\\% = 6000 \\times \\frac{110}{100} = \\underline{6000 \\times 1.1} = 6600,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.422,
            0.442,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This can also be expressed as"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.213,
            0.445,
            0.784,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Amount after 1 year = Principal (P) + rate of interest (r) of P"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
